      "influences": ["Mobilization cost to site", "Whether drone mapping is required", "Level of detail required for county approval or design engineering", "Integration with GIS, CAD, or BIM workflows"],
      "influencesTitle": "What Influences Final Pricing for Our Clients",
      "priceRange": "KES 50,000 – 300,000+",
