  "description": "Required to support planning applications under County Governments and Physical and Land Use Planning Act compliance requirements, ensuring accurate site context, access, and building positioning.",
  "title": "Before submission of architectural and structural drawings for County approval (PPA2 / Development Permission)"
}, {
  "description": "Forms part of the technical documentation required for NCA project registration, alongside approved drawings, BoQs, and consultant engagement documents.",
  "title": "Before issuance of construction approval and NCA project registration"
}, {
  "description": "Used by engineers and consultants to support design compliance with statutory standards for grading, drainage control, and service alignment.",
  "title": "For infrastructure design submissions (roads, drainage, water, and utility layouts)"
}, {
  "description": "Required for preparation and approval of mutation plans, ensuring compliance with Survey of Kenya and County physical planning requirements before survey plan authentication.",
  "title": "For land subdivision, amalgamation, and development planning applications"
}],
  "icon": "office-building-marker",
  "title": "NCA and Physical Planning approvals"
}],
